# Travel the Overworld ({5}{U}{U}, Affinity for Towns): with no Town it costs all 7, so Black Lotus (UUU), Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet (5 mana) are short;
# once Bot1 controls one Town (Adventurer's Inn) it costs {4}{U}{U} = 6, paid exactly by those three plus the Inn's {C}, and it draws exactly four cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Adventurer's Inn
Travel the Overworld
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Travel the Overworld.Cast(Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Adventurer's Inn.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Adventurer's Inn.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Travel the Overworld.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 6

[Expect]
